  "nameEn": "Square without a Loop",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Function \"To the end\": while there is no obstacle ahead — step forward, and if there is a lamp here — light it. Call it on every side of the square, turning right between the calls.",
  "descriptionEn": "A function may contain a \"While\" loop with a condition. Describe in it how to walk one side of the square and call it on every side.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Function \"To the end\": while there is no obstacle ahead — step forward, and if there is a lamp here — turn it off. Call it on every side of the square, turning right between the calls."
